abstract: >-
  Manuscript, benchmark definitions, final figure/table generation scripts, and
  reproducibility materials for a manuscript on inverse fitting of
  power-diagram weights from pairwise separator constraints. The MIT license
  applies to first-party materials; bundled third-party artifacts retain their
  upstream licenses and notices.
